│         │                         ‾‾
│      Article
│      This consequence has a valid justification:
│      ─➤ tests/concolic/bad/context_conflict_on_reentrant.catala_en:11.57-59:
│         │
│      11 │     definition o under condition x=0 consequence equals 20
│         │                                                         ‾‾
│      Article
│
└─
